DTSTART:20260917T213000Z
DTEND:20260917T233000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join the African American Cultural Center (AACC) for the EQUIP 
 orientation and to learn how this year-long initiative can help you create
  the college experience you want in and outside of the classroom. EQUIP st
 ands for Empower\, Question\, Understand\, Initiate and Partner. The initi
 ative is designed to help first-year students:\n\nEmpower themselves to cr
 eate the college experience they wantQuestion everything to build habits f
 or life-long learningUnderstand themselves and what they need to be succes
 sfulInitiate action and be proactive to find resourcesPartner with others 
 to build a network of care and communityAs an EQUIP participant\, you will
 :\n\nEngage in monthly check-ins with a dedicated staff memberAttend learn
 ing labs and AACC signature eventsWork with an embedded AACC counselorAtte
 nd EQUIP special programsDevelop skills in self-awareness\, resilience and
  help-seekingEQUIP supports first-year students at NC State in cultivating
  self-awareness\, community and resilience through AACC signature events\,
  wellness activities and proactive campus resource engagement.\n\nRegistra
 tion is required. Contact Andaiye Qaasim\, assistant director of the AACC\
 , at aaqaasim@ncsu.edu if you have questions.
GEO:35.785108;-78.674529
LOCATION:Witherspoon Student Center\, African American Cultural Center (Roo
 m 356)
SUMMARY:EQUIP Leadership Program Orientation for First-Year Students
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/equip-leadership-program-for-
 first-year-students
