DESCRIPTION:The African American Cultural Center (AACC) will host a gatheri
 ng that will give students in the EQUIP program the opportunity to connect
  with AACC student leaders in a relaxed and supportive environment. Partic
 ipants will build meaningful friendships\, engage in casual dialogue\, sha
 re insights on transition and foster a lasting sense of belonging within t
 he AACC community.\n\nIf you have questions about the gathering or EQUIP\,
  contact Andaiye Qaasim\, assistant director of the AACC\, at aaqaasim@ncs
 u.edu.
GEO:35.785108;-78.674529
LOCATION:Witherspoon Student Center\, African American Cultural Center Room
  356
